    "name": "Flow Builder API",
    "description": "The Flow Builder solution is designed to streamline the creation, execution, and management of transactional flows. By leveraging business rules and data from both internal and external sources, the Flow Builder enables organizations to automate decision-making processes efficiently and securely.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Telesign Customer Support Team\n Email: support@telesign.com",
